00:23:33.060 --> 00:23:34.360
you've never heard before.

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:35.453
Just a slang term.

00:23:37.491 --> 00:23:39.290
I don't know what else to say.

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:40.680
Just a slang term.

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:42.091
- No, that's dope.

00:23:42.091 --> 00:23:43.360
