what the fuck is happening.

00:23:50.848 --> 00:23:53.252
He's paying attention.

00:23:53.252 --> 00:23:54.842
All these artists--

00:23:54.842 --> 00:23:55.675
- Ear to the street, right?

00:23:55.675 --> 00:23:56.789
- Yeah, ear to the street.

00:23:56.789 --> 00:23:58.487
And I'm like, okay cool,
what's hiphop.lunch.com,

00:23:58.487 --> 00:24:01.760
I'm like, what, I haven't heard of--

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:02.593
